    cheering: ['A streak! Bounce bounce!', 'So many days in a row! Wheee!', 'Streak party! Jiggle time!'],
    sleepy: ['Melting into a nap…', 'Bloop… so sleepy…', 'Puddle mode. Zzz.'],
